{
  "rule": "covariant_laplacian_cubed_sphere",
  "metric": "Linf",
  "expected_min_order": 1.8,
  "notes": "Full covariant Laplacian on the gnomonic cubed sphere is O(h²) asymptotically. The gnomonic metric varies significantly near panel corners, producing pre-asymptotic behavior for Nc<32 (order ~1.2-1.5 on {8,16,32}). The asymptotic regime kicks in at Nc≥64: order(64→128)≈1.92, order(128→256)≈1.96, so min order ≥ 1.8 is reliable across the Nc∈{64,128,256} sequence."
